{
  "name": "Featherfall Token",
  "type": "equipment",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>These small feather shaped tokens help significantly reduce the impact of a fall.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"pf2-icon\">R</span> Interact;</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Trigger</strong> You begin to fall</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Effect</strong> When you activate the Featherfall Token, you begin to break the effects of your fall. You may treat the fall as though it were 30 feet shorter. If you are in a Syrania manifest zone - most notably Sharn - you gain the benefits of feather fall for 1 minute or until you stop falling, whichever comes first.</p>"
    },
